{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117160726711-1117_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261117163931\"/><p>事發運頭塘邨運來樓一單位。</p><p>今日(17日)上午11時25分，大埔運頭塘邨運來樓一單位，姓區(53歲)女住戶懷疑在屋內暈倒，家人無法開門報案求助。消防接報到場破門入屋，經檢查證實區婦已經死亡，毋須送院。案件列作「屍體發現」處理，區婦死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:51:18.047056+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:07:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:47:23.936282+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:44:33.508255+00:00","content_hash":"bb2877366525d2455b6233a8efbad5dfd4e7ea57e2d89dc2e77842fae2e5446c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:51:18.047056+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}